<h3 id=3D"Template-TestScope-ValidationChecklist"><strong>Validation Checkl=
ist</strong></h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"align-start" data-local-id=
=3D"af313f8b-ad77-495b-b9c2-b844cffc9f54" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col>
<col style=3D"width: 594.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 1204.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTh"></th>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#e6fcff" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p style=3D"text-align: center;"><strong>Checkpoint</strong></p></th>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#e6fcff" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p style=3D"text-align: center;"><strong>Description</strong></p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd">1</td>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Configuration Validation</p></th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Ensure configurations that impact analytics behavior (e.g., Post Ignitio=
n Seconds, OverspeedV2, LPM No Record, Enhanced Privacy) are enabled and co=
rrectly applied.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd">2</td>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Session Creation</p></th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Confirm session file creation by ndcentral, including initialization of =
INPUT, OUTPUT, and iriscli/files folders</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd">3</td>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Scheduler Checks</p></th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Track state transitions for each session (<code>RUNNING_STATE</code>, <c=
ode>DND_STATE</code>, <code>VISION_RUNNING_STATE</code>, <code>UPLOAD_STATE=
</code>). Ensure each transition is logged and triggers the appropriate pro=
cessing.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd">4</td>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Frame Transfer &amp; Sync</p></th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Validate frame transfer between <code>ndcentral</code> and analytics. En=
sure synchronization across all camera files.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd">5</td>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Real-Time (RT) Processing</p></th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Confirm that <code>inwardAnalyticsClient</code>,<code>outwardAnalyticsCl=
ient</code> &amp; <code>inertialAnalyticsClient</code> initiate RT processi=
ng and run AN modules to detect alerts (e.g., Speeding, FCW, ADD).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd">6</td>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Non-Real-Time (NRT) Processing</p></th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>After RT, verify that NRT modules process frames to detect non real time=
 alerts</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd">7</td>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Analytics Session Process (Outward &amp; Inward)</p></th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Verify session status as Fully Processed, Partially Processed, False, or=
 Dropped (e.g., due to LPM).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd">8</td>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Inertial &amp; Vision Processing</p></th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Confirm that inertial and vision modules process files and generate expe=
cted outputs (<code>outward_vis_obs.obsdata</code>, <code>inward_vis_obs.ob=
sdata</code>, <code>isummary.json</code>).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd">9</td>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Alert Detection &amp; Metadata</p></th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Ensure event codes are detected, incab feedback is triggered and played,=
 and metadata is present for each file.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd">10</td>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Storage Checks (eMMC &amp; DB)</p></th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Verify that all files are stored in SD card or external eMMC and that en=
tries are added to the Circular Buffer database.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd">11</td>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Upload Checks &amp; API Calls</p></th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Validate upload behavior and API calls to IDMS for logs, observations, a=
lert, VOD, event cards, LLA, and EA images.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd">12</td>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Cleanup &amp; Delete</p></th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Confirm deletion of input/output files after upload. Ensure the device i=
s ready for the next session with no file pileup.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd">13</td>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Observation &amp; Health Payload</p></th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Validate Obs &amp; Health payloads for correct event codes, vision statu=
s, incab feedback, file sizes, and other metadata.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd">14</td>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>IDMS Checks</p></th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Ensure event cards are created, videos are available on IDMS, annotation=
s are present for all alerts, and data appears in the Critical Event and Ch=
art sections.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd">15</td>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Error Checks</p></th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Monitor and validate analytics-related errors such as:<br>
- Linux signal crashes<br>
- AN services not running<br>
- Frame delays from Bagheera<br>
- Soft/Hard timeouts<br>
- Drops due to slowdown<br>
- Tracebacks</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd">16</td>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>System &amp; Service Checks</p></th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Overall device stability with respect to other services or functionality=
</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
